@startuml system-context-boundary
title System / Context Boundary ; per ADR-ES-027 section 6 + Recon-ES-004

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "System" as Sys
class "Context" as Ctx

Sys --> Ctx : operates-within
Ctx ..> Sys : shapes

note right
  Per Recon-ES-004:
  Context is the environment.
  System is the organized whole operating within Context.
  System is NOT Context.
end note

@enduml
